    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectFound? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectWithinReach? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO GrabObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO InspectObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsAreaScanned? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveToNewArea\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tDO ScanAreaForObjects\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO Idle\n\tEND\n"
